{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1000_p", "source_sha256": "987f9ae506ea69fc3ddd3cfd61543a0487f361fb779088cf0352a213da5aa738", "ja": "（美奈子達の神社での仕事が終わり、旅館に戻って\nきた。なんか、さっきからいい匂いがする……）", "zh": "（美奈子她们在神社的工作结束后，回到了旅馆。\n从刚才开始就一直闻到一股香味……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "e3364fad3eb9ba110619aefc06c39ad8fc139f040e658dee90a9309b0afe7252", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまですっ！\nまだ起きてますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n还醒着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1002_p", "source_sha256": "31af4608fed1792c340c888c2cfee37cfd43eaf777886dd4b5cff6785c225bef", "ja": "あれ？　お疲れさま。美奈子こそ、\n寝てなかったのか。朝早くて疲れてるんじゃ……？", "zh": "哎？辛苦了。倒是美奈子，\n还没睡吗？早上起得那么早，应该很累了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1003_null", "source_sha256": "0277dd7e6626059cc684368a9c27a205b06b5623f8e3d205badc4009e7135402", "ja": "ぐぅ～……", "zh": "咕噜～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "2cfce15236807e0959ea3352cb45df7cf75f0f93ce8d893835c4d7450579a55a", "ja": "あっ！？　{$P$}さんの\nおなかのアラームが！！", "zh": "啊！？{$P$}先生的肚子警报响了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3a088cb70deea2751125dadf2c7d786605b0e3f186b90a7b9ab2b57108a0edf9", "ja": "うっ、ごめん……。\nなんか、さっきからいい匂いがしててな。", "zh": "唔，抱歉……\n主要是刚才起就一直能闻到很香的味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "af5aa60740004ad42a57e1b7a75c1f7948f70546aa6aca94f27d705941449ee3", "ja": "あ、それ私です！　実は、旅館の台所をお借りして、\nお料理させてもらってたんですよ。", "zh": "啊，是我！其实我刚才借用了旅馆的厨房，做了些料理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "915dc1cc0947942cdf2878860922a0f4bc8bb05f2e3862b0aee1bea02fcc3337", "ja": "神社でついたお餅をもらってきたので、\nそれを使って、お餅のフルコースに挑戦っ！", "zh": "我从神社那边拿到了刚捣好的年糕，\n就用它来挑战年糕全套料理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d0e23f67f14dc3fba8097b537be225e6e42fd5b842a34a96117032f0aaaa8a95", "ja": "そうだったのか。……だけど美奈子、平気なのか？\n日の出前から仕事だったし、ひと休みしたらどうだ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。……不过美奈子，你没事吗？\n你从日出前就开始工作了，要不要休息一会儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "28350467b1405b82ab82b7b85834e0b373640d786c7f4b26acd40768860b7c0d", "ja": "へっちゃらです！　体力には自信がありますし。\nすぐ出来上がるから、待っててくださいね♪", "zh": "完全没问题！我的体力可是很有自信的。\n马上就能做好，请稍等一下哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "f05d2c5eb80a1ea2740160dc4e3ec2c11600f36cb2e20ec4fe9c8fb27809d6fe", "ja": "……っとと、きゃっ！？", "zh": "……哎呀，呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_1011", "source_sha256": "879219f2e9a99f269a98cabd5ce5b3f05fdc56b084d761e81dbdd10b010ddfd2", "ja": "支える", "zh": "支持", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6a68a2f4cf91508382cb1ab3c028246832c77ff43836be4c5632b64b4c3f6dac", "ja": "っと！　急にふらついたな。大丈夫か？", "zh": "等一下！你刚才突然晃了一下。没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2001_019min", "source_sha256": "81bf535945c912ca7539da85c80f1c3f836d8a0bbf6b6671bbaaf8767f1856f0", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……えへへ。\nさっきまで、なんともなかったんですけど。", "zh": "啊，谢谢你……嘿嘿。\n刚才明明还一点事都没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2002_p", "source_sha256": "35872e22d0fe0da18ded8f12b10acf2399c94d885e1f614212d211d273d48416", "ja": "餅つきで、思ったより体力を消耗したのかもな。\nちゃんと休んだ方がいいぞ。", "zh": "可能是捣年糕比想象中更消耗体力吧。还是好好休息一下比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2003_019min", "source_sha256": "ddee293943e94a6cb252cbefd669e815c922a5ba7284cbcbacd82bb5c6593b13", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんの\nおなかが……おなかが……！", "zh": "可是，{$P$}先生的肚子……肚子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2004_p", "source_sha256": "85c294259ac817e1f949d5616ee495964d30895a2f078552f4064ce8baedacb0", "ja": "いや、大丈夫だよ。神社で、とっておきのやつを\n1個もらったからな。あれはうまかった。", "zh": "不，没关系。我在神社拿到了1个珍藏的东西。那个真的很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2005_019min", "source_sha256": "91ce78f6e77b59e92925f30ea81b51951c2f6a23b033ee3082d9ae2636ed3e50", "ja": "ふふっ。とってもおいしそうに食べてましたよね。\nだから私、もっとお料理したくなっちゃって。", "zh": "呵呵，您吃得特别香呢。  \n所以，我更想做更多料理了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2006_p", "source_sha256": "943cc9b5752e469a2c5022fe99d74fa225acb3e947d20454023c7c98bf0e09f0", "ja": "ありがたいけど、無理はダメだ。\nほら、送っていくから部屋に戻ろう。", "zh": "心意我领了，但可不能勉强自己。\n来，我送你，回房间去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2007_019min", "source_sha256": "750ab66bd34256d0b1f44e288a64bef8ad03429f6596329af9110e9875f4c44d", "ja": "うーん、それなら……お餅を焼くだけ！\n焼くだけにしますから！　一緒に食べましょう、ね？", "zh": "嗯——那样的话……只要把年糕烤一下就好！\n就只烤年糕！我们一起吃吧，好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2008_p", "source_sha256": "a0a5451a1dcfb75413761e5d8e008a00b49f7923b50cdb5bf69a53ee45534679", "ja": "あ、ああ……わかったよ。\n一緒に食べて、しっかり休もうな。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……知道了。\n一起吃，好好休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0203_2009_019min", "source_sha256": "efa1516bdb40b3768a82d5dc792d7cd51026fa32218b0f0288639302eb3684b1", "ja": "はい！　愛情込めて、しっかり焼くので……\n期待しててくださいね♪", "zh": "好的！我会满怀爱意，好好烤熟的……请期待哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
